{"w":2400,"h":3396,"lines":[{"c":1,"x":0.069924666912077341,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.12146753946940105,"h":0.016249467964307152,"y":0.036206661207730195},{"t":"We have also received a request for a sales manager for a chain of garden centres. You","w":0.69971659342447923,"x":0.071960636792149826,"h":0.015574985454725576,"y":0.081292131949241009,"c":1},{"x":0.071958365460164611,"y":0.09676998502659806,"h":0.015155573756169605,"w":0.68118199666341139,"c":1,"t":"will be visiting centres in the region to ensure their high levels of customer service are"},{"h":0.013084819375836831,"y":0.11336866910713572,"c":1,"t":"maintained. This post is only suitable for someone who is prepared to live in the region.","w":0.69547322591145833,"x":0.072016473535410477},{"t":"There is also a vacancy for a tree technician to carry out tree cutting, forestry and","x":0.071970093908818367,"y":0.13491760226796889,"c":1,"w":0.64621276855468746,"h":0.016245104539239885},{"t":"conservation work. Candidates must have a clean driving licence and have training in safety","x":0.07201645969562738,"y":0.15106007064044569,"w":0.73045267740885411,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.71823160807291664,"h":0.014430188739538496,"y":0.16614538755365937,"x":0.074005777042737003,"t":"procedures. A year's experience would be preferred but the company might be prepared to"},{"w":0.59053497314453118,"x":0.07201646409033477,"c":1,"t":"consider someone who has just completed an appropriate training course.","y":0.18313953477230727,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"h":0.014911825721480088,"c":1,"y":0.20469882208367729,"t":"Finally, we have a position for a farm worker. This will involve a wide range of farm duties","w":0.70585906982421875,"x":0.074024934167741113},{"x":0.072016469618504664,"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.22084805637795946,"c":1,"t":"including crop sowing and harvesting, machine maintenance and animal care. Perks of the","w":0.72016459147135414},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"job include the possibility of renting a small cottage on the estate, and the chance to earn a","x":0.069958855511827858,"c":1,"y":0.23691860453122193,"w":0.72633743286132812},{"y":0.25072695254572608,"w":0.63596038818359368,"c":1,"x":0.073988104600061416,"t":"competitive salary. A driving licence and tractor driving experience are essential.","h":0.01589484658482776},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.097383720793440598,"c":1,"t":"Q18","x":0.84156378661177522,"w":0.037037035624186254},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.16569767426017146,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q19","x":0.84156378661177522,"c":1},{"x":0.84156378661782694,"t":"Q20","y":0.23546511614037779,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"PART 3","x":0.074074075254134689,"y":0.30948174312983223,"c":1,"w":0.10288065592447916},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.069958848261678544,"t":"ADAM:","y":0.34011627893999719,"c":1,"w":0.051440327962239588},{"w":0.59053497314453129,"h":0.016036308275094724,"t":"OK Rosie, shall we try to get some ideas together for our presentation on","y":0.33716136628402693,"x":0.16255144336112617,"c":1},{"w":0.13991769154866537,"c":1,"t":"diet and obesity?","h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.16872428176167556,"y":0.35306242664192145},{"c":1,"x":0.074074074174771312,"w":0.047325102488199863,"t":"ROSIE:","h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.37063953475595302},{"x":0.072016461327916517,"t":"ADAM:","y":0.38517441838387989,"w":0.047325102488199863,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.4156209090040035,"x":0.074036496710066679,"w":0.047400258382161442,"t":"ROSIE:","h":0.011781437517756954},{"w":0.047325102488199863,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"ADAM:","x":0.072016460998698434,"y":0.44767441847488088},{"y":0.51004538126190047,"h":0.0089790048812667944,"x":0.07402707868636306,"t":"ROSIE.","c":1,"w":0.047419093449910507},{"c":1,"y":0.52470930222644818,"t":"ADAM:","w":0.045267489751180015,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.07407407395646956},{"c":1,"t":"ROSIE:","h":0.010237860033733948,"x":0.074061015917699036,"y":0.53921246520531907,"w":0.04940883318583171},{"w":0.045394226710001609,"t":"ADAM:","y":0.57107844791587015,"h":0.010459383188344273,"c":1,"x":0.07401070547736871},{"y":0.60174418594918389,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.049382715225219725,"t":"ROSIE:","x":0.07407407438774799,"c":1},{"x":0.07407407395646956,"y":0.70203488360527466,"w":0.045267489751180015,"t":"ADAM:","h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1},{"t":"ROSIE:","c":1,"x":0.076131687336146975,"y":0.79505813943575043,"w":0.047325102488199863,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"y":0.80959302303720315,"x":0.07613168734168535,"w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1,"t":"ADAM:","h":0.010174418787512574},{"y":0.82541455163918032,"x":0.073996351520079731,"t":"ROSIE:","w":0.049538160959879562,"h":0.011961594346836191,"c":1},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"I can talk about the experiment I did to see if people can tell the difference","y":0.38221436959152211,"x":0.17078188803717334,"w":0.58847737630208341},{"c":1,"w":0.36213991800944006,"y":0.39958775029061666,"t":"between real sugar and artificial sweeteners.","x":0.16872427957310615,"h":0.013250883392226021},{"c":1,"h":0.01705411971668469,"t":"Where you gave people drinks with either sugar or artificial sweeteners and they","x":0.16866310404419418,"y":0.41215485776080163,"w":0.6400474548339844},{"c":1,"x":0.16862077047580853,"t":"had to say which they thought it was?","y":0.42870595053876404,"h":0.015747579163460368,"w":0.30270179748535164},{"x":0.16866076901391439,"t":"Yeah. It took me ages to decide exactly how I'd organise it, especially how I could","w":0.65034601847330731,"h":0.017582071683993838,"c":1,"y":0.4429997116362594},{"t":"make sure that people didn't know which drink I was giving them. It was hard to","y":0.45930232544547533,"c":1,"x":0.16872427639977844,"h":0.014534883982160851,"w":0.63374486287434895},{"y":0.47343956937834042,"h":0.018360032911716173,"t":"keep track of it all, especially as Ihad so many people doing it - I had to make","w":0.62568440755208332,"x":0.16864482308216888,"c":1},{"w":0.45884775797526045,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.49116607775797161,"c":1,"x":0.16872426915957409,"t":"sure I kept a proper record of what each person had had."},{"y":0.50535761514326483,"x":0.17064585557298198,"w":0.32743817647298179,"h":0.015928018500302232,"t":"So could most people tell the difference?","c":1},{"h":0.014546867815428799,"c":1,"x":0.17078190173728161,"w":0.55349792480468751,"y":0.52179034161354076,"t":"Yeah - I hadn't thought they would be able to, but most people could."},{"x":0.1728395192973077,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Then there's that experiment I did measuring the fat content of nuts, to see if the","c":1,"w":0.63786005655924483,"y":0.53621908103919191},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.55232558126032905,"w":0.45267491658528647,"c":1,"t":"nutritional information given on the packet was accurate.","x":0.17078188319257936},{"c":1,"y":0.56831395335518886,"t":"The one where you ground up the nuts and mixed them with a chemical to","w":0.59259256998697918,"x":0.17078190420295064,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"t":"absorb the fat?","w":0.12345678965250653,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.17078189314606249,"c":1,"y":0.58421672559983573},{"y":0.59728033112593903,"w":0.59066080729166659,"c":1,"h":0.016674199008829382,"x":0.17072027530484385,"t":"Yes. My results were a bit problematic - the fat content for that type of nut"},{"c":1,"w":0.59259256998697918,"t":"seemed much lower than it said on the package. But I reckon the package","x":0.17078190624107834,"y":0.61336866895539965,"h":0.01453830777405285},{"t":"information was right. I think I should probably have ground up the nuts more","c":1,"h":0.016974428938471342,"x":0.17069047679151225,"y":0.62756102201311925,"w":0.61335403442382808},{"y":0.64343404579035313,"t":"than I did. It's possible that the scales for weighing the fat weren't accurate","x":0.16866580508793541,"w":0.60092234293619795,"h":0.016680315329975159,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.17070586275098729,"w":0.51865091959635412,"h":0.016565591342597941,"y":0.65952545539522667,"t":"enough, too. I'd really like to try the experiment again some time."},{"y":0.6990577151746622,"t":"So what can we say about helping people to lose weight?","h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.45884775797526045,"x":0.17078188231790789,"c":1},{"h":0.014546867815428799,"x":0.17489712583964831,"y":0.71366279056448201,"c":1,"t":"There's a lot we could say about what restaurants could do to reduce obesity. I","w":0.62345677693684898},{"x":0.17283951900024211,"y":0.72965116268208208,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"read that the items at the start of a menu and the items at the end of a menu are","w":0.63786005655924483,"c":1},{"w":0.617283935546875,"c":1,"y":0.74411071843161403,"t":"much more likely to be chosen than the items in the middle. So, if you put the","x":0.17078190135256685,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"x":0.17067367770730121,"y":0.75755662875969909,"h":0.018266076895598116,"w":0.63393686930338533,"t":"low-calorie items at the beginning and end of the menu, people will probably go","c":1},{"x":0.17283951831769209,"y":0.77616279059073945,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.5864197285970052,"t":"for the food with fewer calories, without even realising what they're doing."},{"w":0.56378601074218748,"t":"I think food manufacturers could do more to encourage healthy eating.","y":0.7906360425429334,"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.17078189579488698,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.17078189295323379,"y":0.80668604679220235,"w":0.049382715225219725,"t":"How?","h":0.013081394460653373},{"c":1,"w":0.5988553365071615,"h":0.017317385499412752,"x":0.17073023735176796,"y":0.82146419615697908,"t":"Well, when manufacturers put calorie counts of a food on the label, they're"},{"w":0.62367085774739583,"h":0.016049568167283201,"y":0.83677949068606805,"c":1,"t":"sometimes really confusing and I suspect they do it on purpose. Because food","x":0.17273573969243672},{"t":"that's high in calories tastes better, and so they'll sell more.","y":0.85453474699221754,"w":0.47325103759765619,"x":0.17283950166692122,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"x":0.82510288201984683,"y":0.62790697659937944,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"w":0.074074071248372397,"t":"Q23\/Q24"},{"h":0.011763134609262926,"y":0.64382773500498802,"t":"Q23\/Q24","x":0.82508172947200975,"w":0.074116376241048165,"c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q25","h":0.013081394460653373,"x":0.84567901325786576,"y":0.74273255842010921,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q26","y":0.82122093007652963,"x":0.84567901295527559,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"x":0.076131686472738144,"w":0.039094651540120443,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"112","y":0.9098837207742041},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.7195350506869308,"y":0.95567424053906158,"w":0.25425305684407551,"h":0.026919091969412445,"c":1}]}